<title>POLAND: SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN POLISH FIRST DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN POLISH FIRST DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the Polish</p>
<p>first division at the end of the season on Wednesday:</p>
<p>18 - Miroslaw Trzeciak (LKS Lodz)</p>
<p>17 - Jacek Dembinski (Widzew Lodz), Cezary Kucharski (Legia</p>
<p>Warszawa)</p>
<p>15 - Slawomir Wojciechowski (GKS Katowice</p>
<p>14 - Mariusz Srutwa (Ruch Chorzow)</p>
<p>12 - Slawomir Majak (Widzew Lodz), Piotr Reiss (Lech</p>
<p>Poznan), Krzysztof Zagorski (Odra Wodzislaw).</p>
</text>
